<title>INDONESIA: Bimantara pays 20 rph dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Bimantara pays 20 rph dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conglomerate Bimantara Citra, which is controlled by President Suharto's son Bambang Trihatmodjo, said on Tuesday it would pay a dividend of 20 rupiah per share for 1996, compared with 12.30 rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The dividend payment was approved by shareholders at the company's annual meeting in Jakarta.</p>
<p>Details of when the dividend would be paid and the record date would be decided later, company officials said.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
